  "dialogue.vsratie_dushi.line": "%s: %s",
  "dialogue.vsratie_dushi.keykeeper.first.0": "Steps... Living steps. Nobody has walked here on their own two feet for a long time.",
  "dialogue.vsratie_dushi.keykeeper.first.1": "I am blind, but I know my keys by touch. This one opens your luck. A joke. Take this instead.",
  "dialogue.vsratie_dushi.keykeeper.first.2": "Drink from the flask when things get bad. When it is empty, sit by a hearth and it will fill itself.",
  "dialogue.vsratie_dushi.keykeeper.first.3": "And do not play the hero: the souls you carry stay where you fall. Come back in time and they are yours again.",
  "dialogue.vsratie_dushi.keykeeper.idle.0": "The Gravedigger still digs in the churchyard. He has laid the whole borough down and cannot stop.",
  "dialogue.vsratie_dushi.keykeeper.idle.1": "If you hear a watchman's bell, strike him first. Otherwise the whole street comes running.",
  "dialogue.vsratie_dushi.keykeeper.idle.2": "The hounds are quick but frail. Raise your shield, wait for the leap, then strike.",
  "dialogue.vsratie_dushi.keykeeper.idle.3": "The guards hide behind their shields. Wait for them to strike, or get behind them.",
  "dialogue.vsratie_dushi.keykeeper.idle.4": "Roll. At my age it does not work any more, but you are just right for it.",
  "dialogue.vsratie_dushi.keykeeper.idle.5": "The road past the churchyard leads to the Stockade. Up there the sun will not set, and down here it will not rise.",
  "dialogue.vsratie_dushi.keykeeper.idle.6": "See it glowing in the ash? That is a flask shard. Pick it up: one more gulp for you.",
  "dialogue.vsratie_dushi.keykeeper.idle.7": "Spend your souls at a hearth. The dead have no use for them.",
